    },
    "note": "Required scale = min(maxScale, width/1920, (height/1080)*1.215), with a small tolerance. This intentionally catches layouts that are collision-free but visually underscaled. V3 also enforces absolute wide-desktop floors so the first post-1920 cases cannot pass while remaining visually laptop-sized.",
